  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "咕！他们还在反击！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "碎骨！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "只要现在击退他们，我们就能胜利了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "现在......只能战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "这些人......有点难缠！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "呃——！那面盾，可恶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "没错，她，她是龙门近卫局的......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "如果你们现在放下武器投降，你们还有机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "除非想白白送命的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "我们怎么可能会相信你的话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "别骗人了！乌萨斯......不是没有劝降过感染者。一个接一个的，最后都被处决了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "而我趴在死尸堆里，苟延残喘，最后活了下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "你们这些家伙为了消灭我们......做出来的事情有多卑鄙都不稀奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "不就是要把我们感染者，赶尽杀绝吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "那就战斗到最后一刻吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "个子很大的小姐，无论你现在说什么，他们可都是听不进去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "毕竟他们可没法分辨龙门的好人和乌萨斯的恶人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "在那个地方——不，在很多地方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "普通人和感染者之间，就是只有互相憎恨而已，没别的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "看来......已经无法交流了。明明出路就摆在眼前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "出路？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "......我们，能做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "你，又能做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "不要和她废话了！碎骨！我们一起干掉他们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "爆炸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局队员",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "他打算从各个地方包围我们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "再这样被动下去侧翼会顶不住的......组织反击！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "碎骨！我掩护你！拿下他们战斗就结束了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "碎骨——————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "我必须......和你们一起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "我必须————！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "————————————"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我们没多少时间了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "星熊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "我准备好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "谨慎行动，别在敌人面前暴露弱点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "不会给他们机会的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局队员",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "小心敌人的冲锋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "阿米娅！别接近敌人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "那，那是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "博士，博士......我该怎么办......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你该做的事，阿米娅。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "可是我......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "对不起，博士......我......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "碎骨",
          "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "碎骨",
          "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "text": "阿......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "碎骨",
          "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "text": "阿米娅......？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "为什么............"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "你......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "会变成这样......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "碎骨",
          "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "text": "阿米娅......大概这就是命运吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "阿米娅！你在做什么？快......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "啧......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "陈长官？我......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "够了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "还是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "这一切该结束了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......陈长官......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "我需要告诉你一件事情。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "从现在开始，你最好对所有感染者一视同仁。那些都是你的敌人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "命运是不公的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "要恨，就恨我吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陈",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "近卫局！进攻！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
